OL,4,CDozens missing after boat carrying     
OL,5,Cmigrants sinks off Senegal's coast     
OL,6,GSenegalese authorities are continuing  
OL,7,Gsearch operations after a boat said to 
OL,8,Gbe carrying between 50 and 100         
OL,9,Gmigrants capsized in the Atlantic      
OL,10,GOcean.                                 
OL,12,FFour bodies have reportedly been       
OL,13,Frecovered so far. Dozens of people are 
OL,14,Fstill missing.                         
OL,16,FPersonal belongings were found on the  
OL,17,Fbadly damaged boat, which washed       
OL,18,Fashore near the village of Yenne,      
OL,19,Fsouth of Dakar. Search operations      
OL,20,Fcontinued throughout Wednesday and     
OL,21,Fwere due to resume on Thursday.        
